{
  "//": "CareGrid AI - Firestore composite indexes. Phase 2 required none. Phase 3 added docs/07 11.2 verbatim. Phase 8 added nine more, because six of the ten realtime listeners in docs/11 2.2 had no working index and would have failed with `failed-precondition` on their first snapshot. The gaps were: the L1 filter variants, L3 (index 6 omitted deletedAt, so QD-8 was unsatisfied), L4, L5 (index 9 carried a `read` field the query does not filter), L6 (index 8 omitted status), and L9. Index 20 is the index docs/11 2.2 calls \"index 5\" and that was never created.",
  "//index_rule": "docs/07 11.2 note, restated because six of the Phase 8 additions exist only for this reason: array-membership fields (array-contains, in) must come BEFORE range and equality fields, AND every `where` clause a query uses must appear in the index. An index with a field the query omits cannot be used, and an index missing a field the query has cannot either - both fail identically.",
  "indexes": [
    {
      "//": "Index 0 — the duplicate-candidate search in `services/geo/find-duplicates.ts`. MISSING until now, which is why every `POST /api/incidents` returned the `duplicate_check_unavailable` warning: the query failed with failed-precondition and `checkForDuplicates` correctly degraded instead of blocking the report. Field order follows `//index_rule`: the array-membership field (`geoCells`, CONTAINS) must come BEFORE the equality and range fields, and every `where` clause the query uses must appear.",
      "collectionGroup": "incidents",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "geoCells",
          "arrayConfig": "CONTAINS"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "deletedAt",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "createdAt",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Index 1 — the dispatcher queue default: active incidents, freshest first.",
      "collectionGroup": "incidents",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "deletedAt",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "status",
          "order": "IN"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "updatedAt",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Index 2 — a citizen's own reports, newest first.",
      "collectionGroup": "incidents",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "reporterUid",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "createdAt",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Index 3 — the admin archive: soft-deleted incidents, newest first.",
      "collectionGroup": "incidents",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "deletedAt",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "createdAt",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Index 4 — responder availability, for the candidate list.",
      "collectionGroup": "responders",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "verification",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "status",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "lastLocationAt",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Index 5 — admin user list, filtered by role and newest first.",
      "collectionGroup": "users",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "role",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "createdAt",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Index 6 — THE GEOSPATIAL ONE. array-contains first, per the field-order rule above.",
      "collectionGroup": "incidents",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "geoCells",
          "arrayConfig": "CONTAINS"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "status",
          "order": "IN"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "updatedAt",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Index 7 — cross-incident status history for the admin view.",
      "collectionGroup": "statusHistory",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "actorUid",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "createdAt",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Index 8 — a responder's own dispatches, newest first.",
      "collectionGroup": "dispatches",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "responderUid",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "dispatchedAt",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Index 9 — mark-all-read: the caller's own unread notifications.",
      "collectionGroup": "notifications",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "recipientId",
